      "floor": 8,
      "textRawHtml": "@<a href=\"/member/panas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">panas</a> 第一轮：<br /><br />Make a plan:<br /><br />A friend asked me to use AI to create some add &amp; sub exercises and print it, for ~ 8 year olds(girls).<br /><br />I want to instead create a interactive webapp to do so. Here are some initial thoughts:<br /><br />1. have a rich set of suitable difficulty exercises. Preferably generated each time, but still within a suitable difficulty.<br />2. it's like duolingo, with format of a quiz or virtual numkeyboard input<br />3. a quiz should be reasonably sized. Like 15~20.<br />4. UI has to look cute. attacting to young little girls.<br />5. Have a feedback at the end.(result summary)<br />6. have a explanation panel at the end or mid-quiz(Must be lightweight and easy to understand, can't use read-heavy  chunks of texts)<br />7. Deploys to github pages<br />8. can this be pure front-end? No backend involved.<br />9. work well in a landscape tablet device(resolution unknown, not ipad, though ipad definitely should be considered), and phones<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />后面几轮都是加需求，像乘除，三位数难度，多页打印和竖式解读（图形解读是他自己弄的）。不过这第一轮就已经成型了。",
      "textZhHtml": "@<a href=\"/member/panas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">panas</a> 第一轮：<br><br>Make a plan:<br><br>A friend asked me to use AI to create some add &amp; sub exercises and print it, for ~ 8 year olds(girls).<br><br>I want to instead create a interactive webapp to do so. Here are some initial thoughts:<br><br>1. have a rich set of suitable difficulty exercises. Preferably generated each time, but still within a suitable difficulty.<br>2. it's like duolingo, with format of a quiz or virtual numkeyboard input<br>3. a quiz should be reasonably sized. Like 15~20.<br>4. UI has to look cute. attacting to young little girls.<br>5. Have a feedback at the end.(result summary)<br>6. have a explanation panel at the end or mid-quiz(Must be lightweight and easy to understand, can't use read-heavy  chunks of texts)<br>7. Deploys to github pages<br>8. can this be pure front-end? No backend involved.<br>9. work well in a landscape tablet device(resolution unknown, not ipad, though ipad definitely should be considered), and phones<br><br><br><br><br>后面几轮都是加需求，像乘除，三位数难度，多页打印和竖式解读（图形解读是他自己弄的）。不过这第一轮就已经成型了。",
      "translationStatus": "translated",
